ona.", "s": 95.16, "e": 95.56}]}, {"start": 97.64, "end": 99.46, "text": " le gosier, j'étais pas serein.", "words": [{"w": " le", "s": 97.64, "e": 97.76}, {"w": " gosier,", "s": 97.76, "e": 98.12}, {"w": " j", "s": 98.26, "e": 98.4}, {"w": "'étais", "s": 98.4, "e": 98.7}, {"w": " pas", "s": 98.7, "e": 99.0}, {"w": " serein.", "s": 99.0, "e": 99.46}]}, {"start": 100.66, "end": 104.48, "text": " La lutte a été dure, mais nous rentrons victorieux, prêt à revenir l'année prochaine.", "words": [{"w": " La", "s": 100.66, "e": 100.78}, {"w": " lutte", "s": 100.78, "e": 100.92}, {"w": " a", "s": 100.92, "e": 101.04}, {"w": " été", "s": 101.04, "e": 101.22}, {"w": " dure,", "s": 101.22, "e": 101.56}, {"w": " mais", "s": 101.68, "e": 101.82}, {"w": " nous", "s": 101.82, "e": 101.98}, {"w": " rentrons", "s": 101.98, "e": 102.4}, {"w": " victorieux,", "s": 102.4, "e": 103.08}, {"w": " prêt", "s": 103.14, "e": 103.28}, {"w": " à", "s": 103.28, "e": 103.4}, {"w": " revenir", "s": 103.4, "e": 103.74}, {"w": " l", "s": 103.74, "e": 103.98}, {"w": "'année", "s": 103.98, "e": 104.12}, {"w": " prochaine.", "s": 104.12, "e": 104.48}]}, {"start": 104.48, "end": 104.96, "text": " Sous-titres réalisés para la communauté d'Amara.org", "words": []}]